WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.208
"Oh my!" cried Mole.

2
00:00:03.209 --> 00:00:06.181
"Shh," said Rat gently.

3
00:00:06.182 --> 00:00:11.298
A very strange sight appeared before them.

4
00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:13.727
It was a strange creature.

5
00:00:13.728 --> 00:00:18.793
He had the legs of a goat and the body of a man.

6
00:00:18.794 --> 00:00:22.754
The horns on his head shone in the dawn.

7
00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:27.675
His kind face had a soft beard.

8
00:00:27.676 --> 00:00:33.009
"Rat, are you still afraid?" asked Mole.

9
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.218
"No," said Rat.

10
00:00:35.219 --> 00:00:40.682
"And yes. He looks as strong as a thunderstorm."

11
00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:46.459
"But as gentle as a summer breeze," said Mole.

12
00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.525
"Look," said Rat.

13
00:00:48.526 --> 00:00:51.277
"He is holding pipes."

14
00:00:51.278 --> 00:00:54.925
"The music!" said Mole quietly.

15
00:00:54.926 --> 00:00:59.467
The kind face smiled at them.

16
00:00:59.468 --> 00:01:04.336
"I think," said Rat, "he is a friend."

17
00:01:04.337 --> 00:01:09.601
The dawn glowed, and a warm breeze touched them.

18
00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:13.448
Then the two animals were alone.

19
00:01:13.449 --> 00:01:17.985
For a moment they felt very sad.

20
00:01:17.986 --> 00:01:21.861
"What did you say, Rat?" asked Mole.

21
00:01:21.862 --> 00:01:24.046
He rubbed his eyes.

22
00:01:24.047 --> 00:01:27.383
"I was just thinking," said Rat.

23
00:01:27.384 --> 00:01:30.769
"Portly might be around here."

24
00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:32.598
"Look!" said Mole.

25
00:01:32.599 --> 00:01:34.234
"There he is!"

26
00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:37.836
Portly woke with a squeak of joy.

27
00:01:37.837 --> 00:01:42.926
"Rat! Mole!" cried the little otter.

28
00:01:42.927 --> 00:01:46.396
"You found me!"

29
00:01:46.397 --> 00:01:49.546
Portly jumped into Mole's arms.

30
00:01:49.547 --> 00:01:54.466
But Rat stared at hoof marks in the sand.

31
00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:58.977
"Some . . . big . . . animal was here," said Rat.

32
00:01:58.978 --> 00:02:05.119
He tried to remember something, but couldn't.

